{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56065","headline":"寓玉局山寺感怀 · 杜光庭","name":"寓玉局山寺感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一年一度喜春光，及至秋来又感伤。\n白日似风留不住，青春如水去何忙。\n眼前有路同归路，身在他乡忆故乡。\n若不倾心向真宰，也应憔悴鬓成霜。\n（见民国五年刊周宗麟纂《大理县志稿》卷三十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}